WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Welcome to Traffic Control training. People's safety is our first priority.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
At gates, check access permits and follow entry and exit procedures.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Watch pedestrian crossings and keep people safely separated from vehicles.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Keep emergency routes open and manage parking movements safely.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Stand in a visible, safe position and follow the approved traffic plan.
